{"id":12433,"number":"EFSB24-02","title":"New England Power Company d/b/a National Grid (“NEP” or the “Company”) seeking a determination from the Department of Public Utilities (the “Department”) that, pursuant to G.L. c. 164, § 72 (“Section 72”), NEP’s proposal to construct, operate and maintain a new overhead transmission line (“Rebuilt Line”), in Palmer, West Brookfield and Ware (the “Palmer to Ware Improvement Project” or the “Project”) is necessary, serves the public convenience and is consistent with the public interest. The Rebuilt Line will replace the existing 69 kV O15N overhead transmission line (the “Existing Line\"), which is approximately 10.35 miles long, in the same right-of-way (“ROW”). The Rebuilt Line will consist of new transmission structures and conductor that will be operated at 69 kV but will comply with NEP’s 115 kV design standards should operation at a higher capacity be needed in the future. The Project also includes removal of the Existing Line and the construction, reestablishment and improvement of access routes.","petitioner":"New England Power Company d/b/a National Grid","industry":"Siting","type":"Siting/DPU","division":"Siting","opened":"2024-12-12","closed":"","hearing_officer":"","related":[],"stage":"Briefs","milestones":[{"date":"2024-12-12","label":"Docket opened","detail":""},{"date":"2024-12-12","label":"Initial filing","detail":"New England Power Company d/b/a National Grid"},{"date":"2025-11-18","label":"Evidentiary hearings","detail":""},{"date":"2025-12-12","label":"Initial briefs","detail":""},{"date":"2026-08-26","label":"Evidentiary hearings","detail":""},{"date":"2026-09-03","label":"Reconsideration or appeal","detail":"New England Power Company d/b/a National Grid: On behalf of New England Power Company d/b/a National Grid, please find attached a Certificate of Service certifying that a copy of the Final Decision was served in the above-refenced case on the Town Clerk, the Town Administrator, the Department of Public Works, the Zoning Board of Appeals, and the Building Departments for the Towns of Palmer, West Brookfield and Ware. Submitted on 09-03-2026."}],"fileroom":"https://eeaonline.eea.state.ma.us/dpu/fileroom/#/dockets/bynumber/EFSB24-02","filings":[["2026-09-03","New England Power Company d/b/a National Grid","Correspondence","On behalf of New England Power Company d/b/a National Grid, please find attached a Certificate of Service certifying that a copy of the Final Decision was served in the above-refenced case on the Town Clerk, the Town Administrator, the Department of Public Works, the Zoning Board of Appeals, and the Building Departments for the Towns of Palmer, West Brookfield and Ware. Submitted on 09-03-2026.",[["Certificate of Service Final Decision Palmer-Ware Transmission Project Eversource 09-03-2026.pdf","https://fileservice.eea.comacloud.net/V3.1.0/FileService.Api/file/afdgbhaej?9ccStbZLHgm6%2BOzD%2B1eFOumplo6W2bDYt6kv4l%2BnvFGPcSxI%2BblU344Khxm%2BqpOeg0hKFj9M9l%2FxQR8%2B%2F8GqPvdGgrFe6XR6ngIfa80wd3rxFD8G4j981M2Rna9aVTXA"],["Cover Email Certificate of Service Final Decision Palmer-Ware Transmission Project Eversource 09-03-2026.pdf","https://fileservice.eea.comacloud.net/V3.1.0/FileService.Api/file/afdgbhade?9ccStbZLHgm6%2BOzD%2B1eFOgPJ5%2F8CVYih3Bx1LYi4M9CPcSxI%2BblU344Khxm%2BqpOeg0hKFj9M9l%2FxQR8%2B%2F8GqPvdGgrFe6XR6ngIfa80wd3rxFD8G4j981M2Rna9aVTXA"]],"appeal"],["2026-08-28","Energy Facilities Siting Board - Presiding Officer","Final Decision","Attached are copies of the Final Decision of the Energy Facilities Siting Board in EFSB 24-02/D.P.U. 24-190. Submitted by Presiding Officer Tarr on 08-28-2026.",[["Final Decision Palmer-Ware Transmission Project EFSB 08-28-2026.pdf","https://fileservice.eea.comacloud.net/V3.1.0/FileService.Api/file/afdefibje?Yzslz6SuHmUiB46Vb9AzIsy0S%2FQxsWCL6MI4Qg87r4aPcSxI%2BblU344Khxm%2BqpOeg0hKFj9M9l%2FxQR8%2B%2F8GqPvdGgrFe6XR6ngIfa80wd3rxFD8G4j981M2Rna9aVTXA"],["Cover Email Final Decision Palmer-Ware Transmission Project EF